{"id":"acbe50cee0754d98","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-diagonalization.md","title":"Diagonalization","display":"df-diagonalization — Diagonalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-diagonalization","aliases":["90-df-diagonalization"],"display":"df-diagonalization — Diagonalization","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-diagonalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-diagonalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonalization — Diagonalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:X\\times X\\to Y\">\\(F:X\\times X\\to Y\\)</span> (function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y\">\\(\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y\\)</span> (diagonal restriction, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{diag}(F)(x)\\coloneqq F(x,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{diag}(F)(x)\\coloneqq F(x,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:X\\times X\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(F:X\\times X\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是关系的特征函数，则相应的对角集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x\\in X:F(x,x)=1\\}\">\\(\\{x\\in X:F(x,x)=1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"F:X\\times X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{diag}(F):X\\to Y,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{diag}(F)(x)\\coloneqq F(x,x).","display":true},{"tex":"F:X\\times X\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{x\\in X:F(x,x)=1\\}","display":false}],"bytes":668,"backlinks":[{"id":"2428c281bc3116d9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonalization]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.m